<section class="page-section"><div class="container"><div class="col-lg-9 mx-auto"><h1 class="section-title">Privacy Policy</h1><p>This migration site does not operate the former PHP contact-mail backend. If you email us or book through Calendly, information you submit is processed to respond and coordinate the meeting.</p><h2>Analytics</h2><p>Analytics may be used to understand aggregate site usage and improve the experience.</p><h2>Third-party services</h2><p>Calendly and other linked services are governed by their own privacy policies.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>Questions can be sent to <a href="mailto:hello@cerebralops.in">hello@cerebralops.in</a>.</p><p><em>Migration draft: verify against current practices before publication.</em></p></div></div></section>
